            <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;参考&#34;&gt;参考&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xA;href=&#34;https://cdn-lfs-us-1.hf.co/repos/e7/07/e7077a163ab0f314cedbb8ddd44667d765205ee536e8b4785fdd0872534107db/274a19a2577ed220cd3a102b4469c44310e4a7c8e8f8ebc36842d907cb51e127?response-content-disposition=inline%3B+filename*%3DUTF-8%27%27The_Ultra-Scale_Playbook_Training_LLMs_on_GPU_Clusters.pdf%3B+filename%3D%22The_Ultra-Scale_Playbook_Training_LLMs_on_GPU_Clusters.pdf%22%3B&amp;amp;response-content-type=application%2Fpdf&amp;amp;Expires=1751735939&amp;amp;&amp;amp;Signature=jer8tObN1q6%7Eij8fX2vLIiox2VNNX0yAD9hjDxq9JXGDmzou6ONo7lnwIlrn%7ECbbaP-BXm80YdFMAgI2SbINgrxMfxLHTkp5IVwqppQ1INlC8K6JrZS3T8QlL4aY5jY7wX7SCUvweSuxEWA2QXMYwHWWV2Iy-OQAMkcdvvxDvjIZZwlYZqJ0tccDbpSYrOhNfkMcGYyxhp3HPgcEd6gVPydQE6g2wM8ErR04u-9dzwkJrIBowWrr8OSD9HJraRyr5XObTaBx3NEADn9De8Zyo%7EknwQs4MDxWSueQCYTlCfFElMF0%7EVMXYh%7EVfDSV5lZZiuxCFfke43Z12VSK5cMV%7EA__&amp;amp;Key-Pair-Id=K24J24Z295AEI9&#34;&gt;The&#xA;Ultra-Scale Playbook: Training LLMs on GPU Clusters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xA;href=&#34;https://medium.com/huggingface/training-larger-batches-practical-tips-on-1-gpu-multi-gpu-distributed-setups-ec88c3e51255&#34;&gt;💥&#xA;Training Neural Nets on Larger Batches: Practical Tips for 1-GPU,&#xA;Multi-GPU &amp;amp; Distributed setups | by Thomas Wolf | HuggingFace |&#xA;Medium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.jeremyjordan.me/distributed-training/&#34;&gt;Training&#xA;extremely large neural networks across thousands of GPUs.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;</description>
